    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890150/extras/be36da70cf4ae222ed7383968cc6cea9.poster.avif?t=1751311293\" width=604 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890150/extras/be36da70cf4ae222ed7383968cc6cea9.webm?t=1751311293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890150/extras/be36da70cf4ae222ed7383968cc6cea9.mp4?t=1751311293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the only son in a wealthy family, your life should have been good. But several past traumas have forced you to leave your old life behind you and start anew on the exotic Caribbean island, commonly known as <strong>Euphoria</strong>.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890150/extras/ab708e1a4d12d81123205b4d570ddf4e.avif?t=1751311293\" width=720 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Curious about what this new location can offer, you start getting to know new people and begin to settle in. Your past can't seem to let you go, but luckily, there are good-looking distractions.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890150/extras/73ad59ef54a42a08d78672b57521902b.avif?t=1751311293\" width=720 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>As you get used to your new life, you also meet new girls. Things are starting to look good. Your new employer has an indecent proposal. Will you accept, or do the girls on the beach interest you more?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890150/extras/0d89b49d3b73c0524406b31e88d0eb1b.avif?t=1751311293\" width=720 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Dealing with the aftermath of Gina's disappearance, Lars has a plan to lift everyone's spirits. Maybe a trip to a luxury mansion can set the mood to get to know everyone a better?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890150/extras/1a2b34347530585201c9f0478d0bb806.avif?t=1751311293\" width=720 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>As you get closer to the inevitable season finale, it's time to get romantic with the girls. Who knows when things will go back to normal again.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890150/extras/cb7b66446cd9bdd0787f09b5d2b58894.poster.avif?t=1751311293\" width=604 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890150/extras/cb7b66446cd9bdd0787f09b5d2b58894.webm?t=1751311293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890150/extras/cb7b66446cd9bdd0787f09b5d2b58894.mp4?t=1751311293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >U4iA - Season 1 contains:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > More than 11,000 images that have been rendered in 4K and scaled down to HD to ensure the maximum amount of detail. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 400 animations with a total running length of over 40 minutes. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 120 Licensed songs, including one made exclusively for U4iA. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Free roam events and in-game phone content to break up the basic visual novel experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Several unique paths with exclusive content for each one. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freedom of choice. Romance? Flirt? Friends with benefits? Reject? One? Many? All? Your call!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890150/extras/be36da70cf4ae222ed7383968cc6cea9.poster.avif?t=1751311293\" width=604 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890150/extras/be36da70cf4ae222ed7383968cc6cea9.webm?t=1751311293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890150/extras/be36da70cf4ae222ed7383968cc6cea9.mp4?t=1751311293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the only son in a wealthy family, your life should have been good. But several past traumas have forced you to leave your old life behind you and start anew on the exotic Caribbean island, commonly known as <strong>Euphoria</strong>.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890150/extras/ab708e1a4d12d81123205b4d570ddf4e.avif?t=1751311293\" width=720 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Curious about what this new location can offer, you start getting to know new people and begin to settle in. Your past can't seem to let you go, but luckily, there are good-looking distractions.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890150/extras/73ad59ef54a42a08d78672b57521902b.avif?t=1751311293\" width=720 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>As you get used to your new life, you also meet new girls. Things are starting to look good. Your new employer has an indecent proposal. Will you accept, or do the girls on the beach interest you more?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890150/extras/0d89b49d3b73c0524406b31e88d0eb1b.avif?t=1751311293\" width=720 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Dealing with the aftermath of Gina's disappearance, Lars has a plan to lift everyone's spirits. Maybe a trip to a luxury mansion can set the mood to get to know everyone a better?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890150/extras/1a2b34347530585201c9f0478d0bb806.avif?t=1751311293\" width=720 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>As you get closer to the inevitable season finale, it's time to get romantic with the girls. Who knows when things will go back to normal again.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890150/extras/cb7b66446cd9bdd0787f09b5d2b58894.poster.avif?t=1751311293\" width=604 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890150/extras/cb7b66446cd9bdd0787f09b5d2b58894.webm?t=1751311293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890150/extras/cb7b66446cd9bdd0787f09b5d2b58894.mp4?t=1751311293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >U4iA - Season 1 contains:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > More than 11,000 images that have been rendered in 4K and scaled down to HD to ensure the maximum amount of detail. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 400 animations with a total running length of over 40 minutes. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 120 Licensed songs, including one made exclusively for U4iA. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Free roam events and in-game phone content to break up the basic visual novel experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Several unique paths with exclusive content for each one. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freedom of choice. Romance? Flirt? Friends with benefits? Reject? One? Many? All? Your call!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul>",
